{"id":"a3-u05","level":"a3","order":5,"title":{"en":"Ideas","fr":"Les idées","es":"Las ideas","ar":"الأفكار"},"tip":{"en":"In abstract argument, a claim needs a reason. Link your ideas with \"because\", \"therefore\", \"unless\" and \"even if\", and name the premise you accept before you attack the conclusion.","fr":"Dans une argumentation abstraite, chaque affirmation a besoin d'une raison. Reliez vos idées par « parce que », « donc », « à moins que » et « même si », et nommez la prémisse que vous acceptez avant d'attaquer la conclusion.","es":"En un argumento abstracto, cada afirmación necesita una razón. Une tus ideas con «porque», «por tanto», «a menos que» y «aunque», y nombra la premisa que aceptas antes de atacar la conclusión.","ar":"في الحجاج المجرد تحتاج كل دعوى إلى سبب. اربط أفكارك بـ«لأن» و«إذن» و«ما لم» و«حتى لو»، وسمِّ المقدمة التي تقبلها قبل أن تهاجم النتيجة."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a3-u05-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"truth, knowledge, belief","fr":"vérité, connaissance, croyance","es":"verdad, conocimiento, creencia","ar":"حقيقة، معرفة، معتقد"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u05-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"logic, argument, premise","fr":"logique, argument, prémisse","es":"lógica, argumento, premisa","ar":"منطق، حجة، مقدمة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u05-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"evidence, paradox, contradiction","fr":"preuve, paradoxe, contradiction","es":"prueba, paradoja, contradicción","ar":"دليل، مفارقة، تناقض"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u05-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"ethics, duty, freedom","fr":"éthique, devoir, liberté","es":"ética, deber, libertad","ar":"أخلاق، واجب، حرية"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u05-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"equality, happiness, meaning of life","fr":"égalité, bonheur, sens de la vie","es":"igualdad, felicidad, sentido de la vida","ar":"مساواة، سعادة، معنى الحياة"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u05-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"reality, appearance, perception","fr":"réalité, apparence, perception","es":"realidad, apariencia, percepción","ar":"واقع، مظهر، إدراك"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u05-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"soul, death, time","fr":"âme, mort, temps","es":"alma, muerte, tiempo","ar":"روح، موت، زمن"},"count":11},{"id":"a3-u05-l8","type":"learn","order":8,"title":{"en":"society, progress, tradition","fr":"société, progrès, tradition","es":"sociedad, progreso, tradición","ar":"مجتمع، تقدم، تقليد"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u05-l9","type":"learn","order":9,"title":{"en":"skepticism, dogma, wisdom","fr":"scepticisme, dogme, sagesse","es":"escepticismo, dogma, sabiduría","ar":"نزعة شكية، عقيدة جامدة، حكمة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u05-l10","type":"learn","order":10,"title":{"en":"concept, thought, universal","fr":"concept, pensée, universel","es":"concepto, pensamiento, universal","ar":"مفهوم، فكر، كوني"},"count":9},{"id":"a3-u05-l11","type":"story","order":11,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"a3-u05-l12","type":"review","order":12,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":9}]}
